{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Guns Can\u2019t Walk</i>, movement isn\u2019t just part of the game \u2014 it\u2019s the challenge. You can\u2019t run, you can\u2019t walk\u2026 your only way forward is through recoil. Armed with a skateboard and a shotgun, you\u2019ll use controlled chaos to fling yourself across office floors and into ridiculous situations \u2014 all while racing the clock and fighting gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the punishing spirit of Foddian platformers, <i>Guns Can\u2019t Walk</i> is a rage-inducing, skill-based climb where every mistake costs you progress\u2026 and every perfect landing feels like a victory.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959570?t=1756893384","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959570?t=1756893384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959570/3e065ad05e854a85192b8ce8305a92bbd61ea95c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756893384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959570/3e065ad05e854a85192b8ce8305a92bbd61ea95c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756893384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Guns Can\u2019t Walk</i>, movement isn\u2019t just part of the game \u2014 it\u2019s the challenge. You can\u2019t run, you can\u2019t walk\u2026 your only way forward is through recoil. Armed with a skateboard and a shotgun, you\u2019ll use controlled chaos to fling yourself across office floors and into ridiculous situations \u2014 all while racing the clock and fighting gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired b